OL,4,BDottin out to 'free ball' after        
OL,5,Bhistoric WBBL decision                 
OL,6,GA bizarre dismissal in the Women's Big 
OL,7,GBash saw Brisbane Heat's Sarah Glenn   
OL,8,Gbowling to an empty set of stumps      
OL,9,Gafter Melbourne Renegades new batter   
OL,10,GDeandra Dottin was ruled to have taken 
OL,11,Gtoo long to face the delivery.         
OL,13,FExperienced West Indies all-rounder    
OL,14,FDottin walked out to bat, following    
OL,15,Fthe dismissal of Georgia Wareham, with 
OL,16,Fher equipment in disarray and          
OL,17,Fproceeded to adjust her helmet and     
OL,18,Fbegin putting on her gloves after      
OL,19,Farriving in the middle.                
